# Proxy all /api/* calls from skskprotech.pages.dev straight through to the
# Render backend. Status 200 = transparent proxy (rewrite), not a redirect,
# so the browser URL bar never changes and no CORS preflight is needed -
# the request is same-origin from the browser's point of view; Cloudflare's
# edge does the cross-origin hop server-side.
#
# This exists because public/js/sksk-frontend.js calls fetch('/api/...')
# with relative paths (correct when served by the Node/Express backend
# itself, since that server also serves these static files - see
# api/server.js section 5). On Cloudflare Pages there is no Express server
# behind these static files, so a relative /api/* call would otherwise hit
# pages.dev itself and 404. This file closes that gap without touching JS.
/api/* https://p613-backend.onrender.com/api/:splat 200
